    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s central eye emits an imperceptible, magical wave of negative energy in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=TLqcxF6OYH0LweRo]]-[[lookup @target.template.units activity=TLqcxF6OYH0LweRo]]. [[lookup @target.template.type capitalize activity=TLqcxF6OYH0LweRo]]. [[lookup @target.affects.type capitalize activity=TLqcxF6OYH0LweRo]]s in that area can’t regain Hit Points until the start of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s next turn. An intact Humanoid corpse there instantly rises as a <strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-monster-manual.actors.Actor.mmZombie00000000]{Zombie}</strong> under the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s control and takes its turn immediately after the [[lookup @name lowercase]] on the same initiative count.</p>",
